@page "/"

<PageTitle>Home</PageTitle>

<h1>Template.Blazor.Maui</h1>

<FluentCard>
    <p>
        Every page and component you can navigate to lives in
        <code>Template.Blazor.Maui.Pages</code>. The MAUI Blazor Hybrid host and the Blazor
        WebAssembly host both render these same files - neither has any UI of its own.
    </p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Widgets</strong> exercises a ViewModel, the generated Refit client, and <code>template.api</code>.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
        The React app in <code>src/ui/react</code> renders the same three pages against the same
        API, so the two front ends can be compared side by side.
    </p>
</FluentCard>
